{"step_index":90,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T07:26:19Z","content":"Now fix `DailyMealOptions.css` — overwrite cleanly with correct negative margins:","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":".daily-options {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.daily-options h2 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.daily-options-grid {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n  /* bleed past parent padding so first/last cards aren't clipped */\n  margin-left: -40px;\n  margin-right: -40px;\n  padding-left: 40px;\n  padding-right: 40px;\n}\n\n.daily-options-grid::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Floating cart bar */\n.cart-float {\n  position: fixed;\n  bottom: 24px;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n  background: var(--color-text);\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 12px 20px 12px 24px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n  z-index: 50;\n  animation: cart-slide-up 0.25s ease-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes cart-slide-up {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(16px);\n  }\n\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.cart-float-info {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1px;\n}\n\n.cart-float-count {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n.cart-float-total {\n  font-size: 17px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.cart-float-btn {\n  background: #fff;\n  color: var(--color-text);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  padding: 10px 20px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.cart-float-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-surface-muted);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .daily-options-grid {\n    margin-left: -16px;\n    margin-right: -16px;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    padding-right: 16px;\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Clean rewrite of DailyMealOptions.css with correct negative margin bleed and no stray/duplicate rules.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/moringa-marines/module-6/Mealy-Front---End-build-/src/components/DailyMealOptions/DailyMealOptions.css","toolAction":"Overwriting DailyMealOptions.css","toolSummary":"Fix DailyMealOptions.css"}}]}
