{"step_index":121,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:24:27Z","content":"Will overwrite `FullMenu.css` to clean up all old `.meal-row` rules and set `.meal-list` to a responsive grid. Since the user wants to use `MealOptionCard` (which is card layout), using a responsive grid makes sense.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":".full-menu {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.full-menu h2 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.category-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  padding-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.category-btn {\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.category-btn:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-border-strong);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n.category-btn.active {\n  background: var(--color-text);\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n/* Card Grid Layout */\n.meal-list {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.empty-state {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n","Description":"Overwrite FullMenu.css. Clean out all old meal-row CSS rules and switch meal-list from a flex-column layout to a responsive CSS grid, supporting the card layout of MealOptionCard.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/moringa-marines/module-6/Mealy-Front---End-build-/src/components/FullMenu/FullMenu.css","toolAction":"Overwriting FullMenu CSS","toolSummary":"Clean up and update FullMenu CSS"}}]}
